    "narrative": "The Austin Waves enter today\u2019s slate with **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** (74.56) leading the charge against the exploitable Pecko, whose 5.95 xERA presents a prime opportunity for **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** to leverage his dynamic platoon advantage for a massive day. **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** (72.39) and **Kyle Tucker** (71.13) round out our tier-one starts; **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** benefits from a favorable matchup against Lugo, while **Kyle Tucker** remains a high-floor staple despite a mid-tier xERA opponent. While **Gunnar Henderson** (53.96) and **Coby Mayo** (54.09) face the tougher Liberatore, their presence in the middle of the order keeps them as viable plays, even with the projected platoon drag on **Gunnar Henderson**.\n\nOur most difficult roster choice today involved **Miguel Vargas** (39.33), who just barely missed the 40-point efficiency threshold required to break into the lineup. While **Miguel Vargas** shows excellent xwOBA metrics, the daunting task of facing deGrom\u2014who significantly deflates the scoring ceiling\u2014pushed **Miguel Vargas** into the bench role to preserve our limited game caps. We are proceeding with caution regarding **Jackson Merrill** (49.36) and **Sam Antonacci** (43.60); both are tethered to the elite SP_xERA of Paul Skenes and deGrom, respectively. While **Sam Antonacci** maintains value through his spot at the top of the lineup, the matchup risk against such high-tier pitching necessitates a watchful eye on potential early-inning pull-back if the offense stalls.",
